# Allowlist for `wt step copy-ignored` (worktrunk). Only gitignored files
# that also match a pattern here are copied from the primary checkout into a
# new worktree. Patterns are gitignore-style; a bare name matches at any depth.
#
# Copy only hand-maintained files that a fresh worktree cannot regenerate.
# Everything Flutter, Gradle, or CocoaPods generates stays out: files such as
# .dart_tool/flutter_build/*/outputs.json, ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig, and
# ios/Flutter/ephemeral/* record absolute paths into the primary checkout, and
# a worktree build that reads them deleted the primary's generated l10n files
# and wrote build products there (issue #448). `flutter run`, `pod install`,
# and Gradle rebuild all of that on the first build.

# Environment and flavor configuration
.env.*
.envrc

# Firebase configuration per flavor
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Android signing
key.properties
upload-keystore.jks

# Pinned Flutter SDK link (fvm)
.fvm/

# Personal Claude Code permissions for this repo
settings.local.json
